{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "John in Argentina", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Trip to Remember", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Writing a Travel Journal", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A travel journal is a collection of entries about different cities or locations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A travel journal should be small and have a protective cover in case of spills or rain.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It should have blank areas to write your notes or add drawings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you write a journal, you should include:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Who you traveled with (by yourself, with family, or with friends)</li> <li>Where you stayed and if you enjoyed it</li>  <li>Who you met and their contact information </li> <li> Places to eat</li> <li>Things to see and if you would visit again</li> </ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "poet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who writes poems ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The poet was famous in his country.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you e-mail a friend.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "literary ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "of or relating to literature ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was an important literary figure in Argentina.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to meet up ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to come together with someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Let's meet up somewhere halfway.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "time off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "time when you are not at work or at school", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you get time off this year?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to join", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to bring in contact; connect; bring or put together", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Join me on a trip to South America.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le17ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Research a festival or cultural tradition in Argentina.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an e-mail to a friend about a festival you attended (75-100 words).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a suggestion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your e-mail to a partner or family member.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research a festival or tradition in Argentina.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about international customs and festivals.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make suggestions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Travel Journal and the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past </span>Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you write a journal, you generally use the<span class=\"strong\"> Simple Past</span> tense.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "This week I attended El D\u00eda de la Tradici\u00f3n in Argentina.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I met Juan, a local, at the hotel and he suggested that I join his family in the celebrations.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I even tried tango dancing with his sister.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\"> Simple Past</span> tense because the actions or events you talk about in your journal are finished.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le17ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le17ob08re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le17ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn4le17ob08re2img01.jpg", "text": "Dear Peter,<br><br>How's it going at Megatech? <br>", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn4le17ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "<br>This week I attended El D\u00eda de la Tradici\u00f3n in Argentina.  This festival celebrates the birth of Jos\u00e9 Hern\u00e1ndez, a poet who is considered to be one of the greatest literary figures of the country.", "time": "3000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn4le17ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "I met Juan, a local, at the hotel and he suggested that I join his family in the celebrations. He and his wife live about 30 minutes from town.  This week-long festival has concerts, parades, parties and great food. I even tried tango dancing with his sister \u2026 You know I have two left feet!", "time": "16000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn4le17ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "Why don't you see if you can get any time off? We could meet up halfway like Colombia or something. I think it's only about a five-hour flight from here. How far is it from Cambridge? It would be cool if we can hang out in Bogota for a couple days.<br><br>Your buddy,<br>Johnny<br>", "time": "36900", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn4le17ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">A travel journal - What does it look like?</span>", "time": "5000", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What do you include?</span>", "time": "22300", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What information should John include in his travel journal about his experienc